/debug+
/debug:embedded
/filealign:512
/optimize-
/out:<PATH>../../artifacts/obj/Aspire.Cli/Debug/net10.0/aspire.dll
/refout:<PATH>../../artifacts/obj/Aspire.Cli/Debug/net10.0/refint/aspire.dll
